# Goes into the macro.stnmllr.com site block of /etc/caddy/Caddyfile,
# AFTER `import oauth2endpoints` and BEFORE the catch-all `handle { ... }`.
# handle blocks are mutually exclusive and checked in written order — a route
# placed after the catch-all would never be reached (see macro-dashboard AUTH.md).
#
# `handle`, not `handle_path`: the prefix must reach the app, which resolves
# /deepdive/... via root_path (FISHERSCREEN_DEEPDIVE_UI_ROOT_PATH=/deepdive).
# The matcher includes the bare /deepdive so the app can redirect it to /deepdive/.

    @deepdive path /deepdive /deepdive/*
    handle @deepdive {
        import authgate

        reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8765
    }
